{"Each import() runs as soon as appStore is imported, so one unused app package with a missing dependency or top-level error can reject before any caller selects it, creating an unhandled rejection and breaking unrelated calendar, payment, or video flows": 0.8863382935523987, "The async callback passed to forEach is not awaited in reschedule flow, so email is sent and success is returned before calendar or video cleanup finishes, and if getCalendar, deleteEvent, or deleteMeeting rejects, the surrounding try/catch does not catch it and the old external event or meeting can remain": 0.9603599905967712, "In recurring cancellation, the new await getCalendar runs inside an existing unawaited forEach(async ...), so recurring cancellation can move on before these callbacks populate apiDeletes, leaving updated bookings' external events behind after the database has already been marked cancelled": 0.9074962139129639}